# Play test of The Step Pyramid (CIPlay step_pyramid, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The plateau's top at 23.8 m: the pyramid in its middle (four tiers 2.42 m, the top at 33.5 m, the stairway up its north
# face along x 0), the Sun shrine at -28 0 (its doorway east), the Rain shrine at 30.5 0 beyond the moat's stepping stones
# (x 24-27), the well at -6 -26 (its gorge to the sea south); the causeway up the west face from the base camp (-24 46).
island The Step Pyramid
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Rain Kings
wait 5
expect animals Chicken 3
expect animals Turtle 2

# The base camp: the field notes
walk -21 53 to -23 49 to -24 47 h=3
zone basecamp
expect step 1
read Dr. Quintero's field notes
expect step 2

# Up the causeway: two legs along the west face
walk -26 44 to -28 42 to -34.5 32 to -41 22 to -40.2 6.8 to -39.4 -8.4 to -39 -16 to -35 -16 h=23.8
zone causeway
expect step 3

# The terraces: the warthogs
walk -35 -16 to -24 -18 to -18 0 to -18 20 to 10 22 h=23.8
zone terraces
kill Warthog
expect step 4

# The Sun shrine: its doorway staked; the jaguar's-paw lever at the west rim; the tablet - the stepping stones appear
walk 10 22 to -18 20 to -25 6 to -33.5 7.5 h=23.8
use sunlever
expect message grind down into the floor
wait 3
walk -33.5 7.5 to -24 3 to -24 0 to -25.6 0 h=23.85 below=26
open Sun shrine's tablet chest
expect story jade 1
expect step 5
expect shown rainstones

# The sacred well: to its rim, then down into its water; the guardian; the offering box; out through the gorge
walk -24 0 to -18 -10 to -6 -18.6 h=23.8
zone cenote
expect step 6
at -6 -26 h=-3
kill Angler fish
expect step 7
open Well's offering box
expect story jade 2
expect step 8
at -6 -38 h=-1
at -6 -48 h=0.5

# Back up on the plateau: across the stepping stones over the moat to the Rain shrine
at 18 0 h=24
walk 18 0 to 20.8 0 to 22.3 0 to 23.9 0 to 25.5 0 to 27.1 0 to 29.6 0 h=23.85 below=26
open Rain shrine's tablet chest
expect story jade 3
expect step 9

# Up the pyramid's stairway to the summit: the carvings, the altar, the Kings' chest
walk 18 0 to 18 18 to 0 21.5 to 0 18.8 to 0 14.9 to 0 11.3 to 0 7.7 to 0 4.2 to 0 3 h=33.5
zone summit
expect step 10
read The Rain Kings' carvings
expect step 11
use altar
expect message settle into their hollows
open Rain Kings' offering chest
wait 2
expect done

# The other boxes: the camp box, the storehouse, the offering pot, the barrel off the beach
open Base camp box
open Collapsed storehouse
open Offering pot
open Barrel off the beach
